    "n_trusted_reviews_DUlFYg": {
      "type": "n_trusted-reviews",
      "blocks": {
        "slider_78E6pj": {
          "type": "slider",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/andrea.webp",
            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/america_f.webp",
            "username": "Andrea G.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Skin texture",
            "text": "<p>“Still a newbie but so far so great! I have dermarolled for more than a decade-still do with .25 at least one a week. I’ve avoided getting a pen because there’s so much involved-but the Qure system is just awesome. So easy and user friendly and my skin loves the serum! Doing my third treatment Saturday and will definitely be re-ordering 🤗</p>",
            "product_url": "",
            "product_text": "",
            "product_title": ""
          }
        },
        "slider_VyHb4h": {
          "type": "slider",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/shelly.webp",
            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/america_f.webp",
            "username": "Shelly S.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Wrinkles",
            "text": "<p>“I have used the Qure Micro- Infusion System for 3 monthly treatments. The results are clearer, plumper and firmer skin. With further treatments I am looking forward to looking better and better.”</p>",
            "product_url": "",
            "product_text": "",
            "product_title": ""
          }
        },
        "slider_9NRFNC": {
          "type": "slider",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Jennifer_1_treatment.webp",
            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/america_f.webp",
            "username": "Jennifer N.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Smokers Lines",
            "text": "<p>“I am really stunned by how well this product works. I have had professional micro-needling and I wanted the benefits without the downtime. I did my treatment, went to bed and woke up the next morning and was ready to go. My skin looks better than it has in years.”</p>",
            "product_url": "",
            "product_text": "",
            "product_title": ""
          }
        },
        "slider_rM6Vp2": {
          "type": "slider",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Image_19_60a1c45f-d170-40bf-b9f4-b3ef4acc09da.png",
            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/america-flag_f1f6c160-90c6-4ba9-8bfc-d9039a28d2af.webp",
            "username": "Rodrigo M.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Skin Texture",
            "text": "<p>“The process is simple and very easy to follow. You can really see results. People are noticing the glow. Im loving it.”</p>",
            "product_url": "",
            "product_text": "",
            "product_title": ""
          }
        },
        "slider_mB2Ht7": {
          "type": "slider",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Image_1_7c6ee245-826f-4f00-87c0-251044a3fbcb.jpg",
            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/usa_flag.svg",
            "username": "Marilyn B.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Forehead Wrinkles",
            "text": "<p>“I have done two treatments so far. For my second treatment I added numbing cream around my mouth, since it is more sensitive and an area I really need to work on! I found it was easy to do, just put on the needle cap and use a continuous motion. My skin felt truly softer and more plump after usage. I am excited to see the results I get after using this product in the future.”</p>",
            "product_url": "",
            "product_text": "",
            "product_title": ""
          }
        },
        "slider_aF9Qs3": {
          "type": "slider",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Image_59.webp",
            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/america-flag_f1f6c160-90c6-4ba9-8bfc-d9039a28d2af.webp",
            "username": "Andrea F.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Dark spots",
            "text": "<p>“I’ve done three treatments now and have noticed my dark spots, scars and overall pigmentation has significantly improved. The bags below my eyes have lessened and my face looks brighter. I will definitely recommend this to my friends!”</p>",
            "product_url": "",
            "product_text": "",
            "product_title": ""
          }
        },
        "slider_hJ8Nc5": {
          "type": "slider",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Image_49.webp",
            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/usa_flag.svg",
            "username": "Hannah J.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Glow",
            "text": "<p>“I’ve used the micro-infusion dark spot bundle set only one and I can already tell a difference!! My skin is ✨GLOWING✨ I have had several people ask me what I’ve done different just from one use! I cannot wait to continue using this and see the continued progress I’ll have. 10000/10 recommend!!”</p>",
            "product_url": "",
            "product_text": "",
            "product_title": ""
          }
        },
        "slider_lF3Rk9": {
          "type": "slider",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Image_8_fb9b7c49-01c1-48f9-9609-b9d8bdf8bb7d.png",
            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/england_f_7b85ce69-2b67-4245-a148-3dd808fc574a.webp",
            "username": "Lourdes F.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Wrinkles",
            "text": "<p>\"I am loving the micro infusion. I was skeptical because nothing ever works for my face, except Botox. But let me tell you, I am seeing a difference already. I've only done three treatments and the my face looks so much better... It is a little painful in certain areas but for the few seconds of pain, it's worth it! Definitely give it a try and see for yourself.\"</p>",
            "product_url": "",
            "product_text": "",
            "product_title": ""
          }
        },
        "slider_jT7Wd4": {
          "type": "slider",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Image_2_9c05b808-aa78-4254-8031-9fea7eda6afe.png",
            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/usa_flag.svg",
            "username": "Janeda T.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Dark spots",
            "text": "<p>“I’ve done two treatments so far since I got this and my gosh, I have an extreme loss of dark spots. My skin is smooth and I got the dark spot treatment, but it Oohh amazed at this I keep telling everybody about this I cannot believe what an amazing product this is I will continue to buy it, and I will not stop using this for a treatment that you would spend $300 in the salon for just one treatment, how amazing is it to be able to do it at home?”</p>",
            "product_url": "",
            "product_text": "",
            "product_title": ""
          }
        },
        "slider_e11ie1": {
          "type": "slider",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ellie_6_treatments.webp",
            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/america_f.webp",
            "username": "Ellie V.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Glow",
            "text": "<p>“I just turned 57 years. My skin was extremely dry and while using this product my skin RETURNED to LIFE! I am so impressed with it! My Coworkers ask me what I use in my skin.. and I tell them. Product easy to use and the needles are better that using a pen for microneedling. This is an amazing product that you will not regret in purchasing it. I really see the change in my skin. Outstanding job QURE!”</p>",
            "product_url": "",
            "product_text": "",
            "product_title": ""
          }
        },
        "slider_pJ4Kw1": {
          "type": "slider",
